description	"Sith Master

Customizable Sith Master, Adept in all forms of combat, choose your focus and dominate the galaxy!

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Short Lightsaber
-- Single Saber (Red/Yellow/Blue)
-- Dual Sabers (Duals/Cyan/Blue)
-- Double Bladed Lightsaber (Staff/Red/Purple)
-- Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
-- Saber Deflect (1)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Saber Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Force Focus (2)
- Force Block (1)
- 10% Less Knockback Taken"